      "text": "You are confusing the medium with the message. I do not grade conversations. I grade syllables. If you are counting your own words like they are credit points, you are doing the work for me."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "She leans back in the chair, arms crossed over her chest, the wet hem of her coat still dark against the light fabric. Her gaze is steady, waiting for the implication to land or dissolve."
