      "text": "She sets the pen down with a sharp click, her gaze narrowing as she waits for you to either correct the premise or defend it."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "dilek-sahin",
      "text": "So. Are you going to tell me why you are actually here, or are we going to stand in this awkward, rain-soaked silence until I decide to leave?"
